{
 "id": "1411b9e0-fbc9-4544-9bca-6c91d64f9e09",
 "name": "anchor: product user external id",
 "tags": [
  "anchor"
 ],
 "description": "anchor#268: a product user created with external_id (product is its own identity provider) is named by that id in access evaluation, no Clerk. Duplicate 409 PRODUCT_USER_EXTERNAL_ID_ALREADY_EXISTS, case-sensitive (upper case = another user), blank/empty/256-char/non-ASCII 400, no update route (405), NOT_A_MEMBER before membership, allow with role + email after, unknown id SUBJECT_NOT_SYNCED. Own product deleted always. Generator: echopoint-investigation/gen_external_id.py.",
 "updated_at": "2026-11-03T15:14:18.116945Z",
